Cell[TextData[{
 "The segment graph contains all shortest paths from ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 " to ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 ", oriented toward ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 ". A central vertex minimizes Max[d(p,v),d(v,q)] within this graph. Even \
endpoint distance gives one middle layer; odd distance gives both middle \
layers. Disconnected endpoints give an empty family; equal anchors give one \
point. Sampling is uniform over distinct central vertices. The InfraMidpoint \
\"VertexDensity\" measurement separately counts shortest-path occupation at \
each center."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"a90f3a2e-015f-4e9d-8241-05a9124e8c59"],

Cell["\<\
The graph must be finite, simple, undirected and unweighted, with valid \
anchors. Omitted count or Automatic gives one uniformly random vertex; an \
empty pool gives {}. An integer gives that many distinct vertices, or {} when \
too few exist. UpTo[n] gives at most n distinct vertices; All gives the \
complete pool in graph vertex order. Zero gives {}; negative counts and \
unsupported options stay unevaluated.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"d86d85c4-8e40-4692-b30d-8ffeb0deba35"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "\"NextVertexFunction\" defaults to Automatic. Identity selects in graph \
vertex order. These are the only supported selector values. All and Identity \
are deterministic. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"RandomSeeding", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7182a341-ea17-4a48-9db4-18cdfa1042e6"],
 " (default) seeds each call afresh, independently of ",
 Cell[BoxData["SeedRandom"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bf8c12c3-1c8d-45c3-834a-ee22d561681f"],
 "; an integer or string gives a reproducible draw, and ",
 Cell[BoxData["Inherited"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "edf80c0d-ee92-47be-a8d7-a3c114138e12"],
 " a local snapshot of the current state. The outer random state is restored \
afterward, as with ",
 ButtonBox["RandomInstance",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/RandomInstance.html"], 
    None}],
 ". List-valued points remain intact. For an empty-List vertex, All and count \
1 distinguish {{}} from an empty pool."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"9eeb2dd5-ab36-4136-913e-ec961b2ed282"]
}, Open  ]],

